1. Receive in triplicate, properly accomplished refundable/exempt/ break-even BIR Form No. 1701A/1701C from taxpayer;

2. Process ITRs in a similar manner as the VAT returns in accordance with pertinent provisions of RMO No. 31-91 as amended by RMO 43-91 and release to taxpayer the duplicate copy of the return; cd i

